{"overview":"ساساکی، کارمند اداری در میانه‌ی عمر، در ژاپن زندگی می‌کند. خسته از دنیای بی‌روح شرکت‌ها، به فروشگاه حیوانات می‌رود تا همراه جدیدی پیدا کند. در آنجا پرنده‌ای دوست‌داشتنی به نام پیپس را پیدا می‌کند و او را به خانه می‌آورد. اما ساساکی به زودی می‌فهمد که پیپس پرنده‌ی عادی نیست… او یک جادوگر قدرتمند از دنیای دیگر است! با هم، در یک ماجراجویی جادویی پر از شمشیر و جادو سفر می‌کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Sasaki is a middle-aged office worker living in Japan. Feeling drained by the vapid corporate world, he heads to the pet shop in search of a new companion. There he finds an adorable bird named Peeps and takes him home. But Sasaki quickly learns that Peeps isn’t your average bird…he’s a powerful mage from another world! Together, they embark on a magical adventure filled with swords and sorcery.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2024,"poster":"/m3D7giT0fyJJ5ssjOEhYgUXN7Sg.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/itOssMSSSumlnIiXmdsAh426nEW.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"杉田智和","role":"Sasaki (voice)","photo":"/cv5zuPZySNsHXu24pjKLYCRzJ2J.jpg","en":"Tomokazu Sugita"},{"name":"悠木碧","role":"P-chan (voice)","photo":"/a5Mkd66GV1l3c9bZZtnvjUf33T2.jpg","en":"Aoi Yuki"},{"name":"高橋李依","role":"Hoshizaki-san (voice)","photo":"/aeB7z0cBTASdjKOjQriBAO6hYq4.jpg","en":"Rie Takahashi"},{"name":"鬼頭明里","role":"Otonari-san (voice)","photo":"/AoRQOZRC0yINB0WeKnM569rV1wF.jpg","en":"Akari Kito"},{"name":"富田美憂","role":"Elsa (voice)","photo":"/rSR17l4HdchLkhpRuAZbGbXNmUS.jpg","en":"Miyu Tomita"},{"name":"水瀬いのり","role":"Magical Pink (voice)","photo":"/cqOrQDUbbQLKpujzcK47YqjFdNp.jpg","en":"Inori Minase"},{"name":"置鮎龍太郎","role":"Akutsu (voice)","photo":"/qbj3cFQqWwZ6x7S1jEpOJa57sEZ.jpg","en":"Ryotaro Okiayu"},{"name":"大空直美","role":"Shizuka Futari (voice)","photo":"/qygKX6EtfvPdnPsMM0d41mPztP2.jpg","en":"Naomi Ohzora"},{"name":"安元洋貴","role":"Viscoun